{"title":"Copperhead","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 7 times (1.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .25 | venomDamage: 8 | venomDurationMs: 4e3</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>279</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>656</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>463</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>57</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-medium?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>279</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/copperhead-me